<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51207" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσο-χειλής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>level with the brim</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριθαὶ ἰσοχειλεῖς</span> grains of
			malt <i>floating level with the brims</i> of the vessels, i.e. on
			the surface of the liquor, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωρὸν κεράσας ἰσοχειλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.105
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. τὴν κάτω σιαγόνα ποιήσας [ὁ
				βάτραχος</span>] <i>level with the surface of the
			water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				536a16
			</span></i>: c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐφράτης ἰ. τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.7.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>equally full</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				31.2
			</span></i>.</div>
